    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d752">

                <pb facs="0805" n="791" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg791"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.20210/2768a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bowers</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-03-02T19:00:00-04:00">March 2, 1944—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>265. Information reaching Department indicates that PQZ Case is not being
                    prosecuted effectively, that nine subjects in the case have <pb facs="0806"
                        n="792" xml:id="pg792"/> been released and that the Judge in charge refused
                    to issue necessary orders for arrests, and the case gives every indication of
                    following the same lines as PYL Case, which you will recall, through lack of
                    proper legal procedure was allowed to completely disintegrate. Please discuss
                    these questions with the Foreign Minister<anchor n="59" xml:id="d752-f1"/>
                    emphasizing to him the necessity for taking vigorous and conclusive action.</p>
                <p>Department intends to follow similar lines with the Chilean Ambassador
                        here.<anchor n="60" xml:id="d752-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d752-f1" n="59" xml:id="d752-f1-content">
                <p>Joaquín Fernández Fernández.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d752-f2" n="60" xml:id="d752-f2-content">
